<title>USA: CCC invites bids for about 10 mln bu feedgrains.</title>
<headline>CCC invites bids for about 10 mln bu feedgrains.</headline>
<dateline>CHICAGO 1997-04-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Commodity Credit Corp of the U.S. Department of Agriculture said it was inviting bids for a total of 9,925,137.28 bushels of corn and 91,143.53 bushels of barley in a catalog sale.</p>
<p>Offers must be received by 1430 CDT on May 6 for reply the following day. The grain is currently stored in U.S. warehouses.</p>
<p>((Nigel Hunt 312-408 8720))</p>
</text>
